OL,3,AIsrael opens up tenders for
OL,4,Acontroversial West Bank settlement
OL,5,Aproject
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe deadline for bids is days before
OL,8,FIsrael's October's general election,
OL,9,Fmaking it much harder for any future
OL,10,Fgovernment to overturn any tenders
OL,11,Fissued.
